; Path is empty — the index pass walks outside path tracking (same as
; `cross-ref-duplicate` and `cross-ref-multi-target-duplicate`).
;
; One diagnostic is the whole assertion, and the two silences beside it
; carry as much: `:depth 1` on the nested space does not fire
; `unknown_key` (the head resolved to the local, which declares it, not to
; the global, which does not), and `:space title` does not fire
; `not_cross_ref` (the nested local instance registered as a target).
(diagnostics
  (diagnostic :code duplicate_cross_ref_target :path []))
